{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"41000121963","bookName":"Renuncio a ustedes siete (Doblado) ","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x1/41x0/410x0/41000123473/41000123473.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":41162487,"followCount":641800,"introduction":"La heredera Julia Guzmán creció junto a los siete muchachos becados que su familia acogió. Todo cambió hace tres años, con la llegada de Silvia Jiménez, la hija del chofer. Bajo sus constantes calumnias y manipulaciones, los siete comenzaron a sentir rechazo hacia Julia. La situación llegó al extremo cuando Julia presenció cómo ellos, de rodillas, le declaraban su amor a Silvia. Desilusionada y con el corazón roto, decidió cortar definitivamente su relación con ellos.","chapterCount":73,"labels":["Strong Female Lead","Love After Marriage"],"tags":["Strong Female Lead","Love After Marriage"],"typeTwoIds":[336],"typeTwoNames":["Contraataque"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":336,"name":"Contraataque","replaceName":"contraataque"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Contraataque","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"You-re-Out-of-My-Life-Forevermore-DUBBED","bookNameLower":"you-re-out-of-my-life-forevermore-dubbed","shelfTime":"2025-10-31 19:20:53","firstShelfTime":"2025-10-31 18:16:22","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"601367414","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/62/3x7/37x4/374x3/37432100014/603044826_1/603044826.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795201200&Signature=DJfT4wv0SQMxvi01RZpLQ9Hfr4eZNR4moor5TJXCVmf1ubP7Ck9nwlqar75ZZYH9Y~tHkynqD-hagTmjoxh0pOc6USfjAJVm-zOpc-EnMA4E-7zAfIEJdpvGz9O7SSwk-hqIB0gm68TdHaT~Za9FLV7-kukKmYYe-zh7BZ0Ok0j7iEAvJkK1PXrMqGm-EKyt7aHEEZck5kCse-26QXgprQ5yGcyO0AMizhneKHC8iiYByz3Fa3HOnc7sgRIcNgVKdBc2GywxFfje4OuTnbkG~gfOsjbBUg4~g9xHS9E786j9rfffwH2JtggL-eom3J-TEAi72w~lxTIqpgmI98uD~A__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/62/3x7/37x4/374x3/37432100014/603044826_1/603044826.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":240605,"price":0},{"id":"601367415"